GitKB adapter — bboxy450-term
https://github.com/bboxy450/bboxy450-term

Uses the installed GitKB CLI as a separately installed, hash-pinned dependency.
GitKB: https://github.com/gitkb/gitkb-core (MIT; its own notices apply).
No GitKB source is copied or distributed in this adapter. GitKB's versioned
document.read.v1/workspace.write.v1 contracts and source-aware workflow informed
this integration; source references are beside the implementation.

The embedded data_source schema is copied from bboxy450-term:
crates/bbt-plugin/schemas/data_source-1.0.schema.json, under the project LICENSE.
The executable embeds that schema so the host's pinned copy needs no side files.
